OL,3,GNEWSAMurder plot gang jailed over
OL,4,Abotched shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gang who conspired to murder an
OL,7,F18-year-old man injured in a botched
OL,8,Fshooting have being jailed for life,
OL,9,Fwith minimum terms of up to 22 years.
OL,11,FMohammed Khan, Nicholas Buckley,
OL,12,FAlyxander Fraser and Adam Bhayat were
OL,13,Finvolved in the failed plot at a car
OL,14,Fpark on Gosford Street, Coventry, on 12
OL,15,FSeptember 2025.
OL,17,FThe victim was targeted with a shotgun,
OL,18,Fwhich was fired at him at close range,
OL,19,Fand he suffered serious but non-fatal
OL,20,Fhead injuries, West Midlands Police
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
